Hon. Debbie-Anne A. Reese  


November 16, 2026 
Page 9 


I. 
DOCUMENTS SUBMITTED 
The NYISO submits the following with this filing letter: 
1. Affidavit of Thinh T. Nguyen (“Nguyen Affidavit”) (Attachment I); 
2. Affidavit of Zachary T. Smith (“Smith Affidavit”) (Attachment II); 
3. Affidavit of James Ross Altman (“Altman Affidavit”) (Attachment III); 
4. Affidavit of Jonathan Newton (“Newton Affidavit”) (Attachment IV); 
5. Affidavit of Dr. Scott M. Harvey (“Harvey Affidavit”) (Attachment V); 
6. NYISO Large Load Integration Study Process (“LLISP”) Overview Figure 
(Attachment VI); 
7. Large Load Integration Study Process Cycle Figure (Attachment VII); 
8. A clean version of the NYISO OATT Attachment LL sections containing the 
proposed tariff revisions with an effective date of February 1, 2027 (Attachment 
VIII); 
9. A blacklined version of the NYISO OATT Attachment LL sections containing the 
proposed tariff revisions with an effective date of February 1, 2027 (Attachment IX); 
10. A clean version of the NYISO Services Tariff sections containing the proposed tariff 
revisions with an effective date of February 1, 2027 (Attachment X); 
11. A blacklined version of the NYISO Services Tariff containing the proposed tariff 
revisions with an effective date of February 1, 2027 (Attachment XI); 
12. A clean version of the remainder of the NYISO OATT sections containing the 
proposed tariff revisions with an effective date of February 1, 2027 (Attachment XII); 
13. A blacklined version of the remainder of the NYISO OATT sections containing the 
proposed tariff revisions with an effective date of February 1, 2027 (Attachment 
XIII); 
14. A clean version of the NYISO Services Tariff sections containing the proposed tariff 
revisions with an effective date of June 1, 2028 (Attachment XIV); 
15. A blacklined version of the NYISO Services Tariff sections containing the proposed 
tariff revisions with an effective date of June 1, 2028 (Attachment XV); 
16. A clean version of the remainder of the NYISO OATT sections containing the 
proposed tariff revisions with an effective date of June 1, 2028 (Attachment XVI);
